# Normalise line endings. Everything here is source that is read by tools with
# opinions: Go, gofmt, PowerShell and the Python generator. They all cope with
# LF, and mixed endings only create noise in diffs, so LF is stored and checked
# out as-is on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only binary oddities that must not be touched.
*.exe binary
*.syso binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary

# Generated translations: a machine writes these, so they are not worth
# diffing as prose.
i18n.go linguist-generated
